      "writtenOn": "2021-03-09T13:00:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like we are saying that there will simply be no way to fetch the unredacted version of the object using synchronous calls. I wonder if we should provide a version of this method that takes a flag to pass in that information? That said, synchronous calls are generally not something we encourage due to the potential for race conditions, so perhaps this is fine.",
